    {
      "text": "The resulting Cr2O3 layer will remain adherent during high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chromium in the coating oxidizes preferentially to form Cr2O3 at elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::015::3_4_oxidation_resistance"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense chromium-containing oxide scale inhibits oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::015::3_4_oxidation_resistance"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricting oxygen ingress to the zirconium substrate will lower its oxidation rate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::015::3_4_oxidation_resistance",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded interlayer will mitigate thermal-expansion mismatch during rapid thermal cycling.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncoated zirconium-alloy cladding oxidizes rapidly during a loss-of-coolant accident.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protective metallic coatings, including chromium coatings, are used as a strategy to improve the high-temperature oxidation resistance of zirconium-alloy cladding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The chromium-coated cladding will have lower oxidation-related weight gain than uncoated cladding.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::015::3_4_oxidation_resistance",
        "PMC8709257::web::001::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The chromium-coated cladding will develop a thinner oxide scale than uncoated cladding.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will reduce oxidation kinetics by approximately 50% relative to uncoated cladding.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will maintain adequate adhesion during high-temperature steam exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated cladding will retain ductility during high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated cladding will retain mechanical integrity and suitability during normal reactor service.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
